    "text": "By Alvin Estañol ,\n15 hours ago\nIn Kalamazoo, breakfast comes with a little altitude at Crow’s Nest, the second-floor restaurant above Fourth Coast Cafe on South Westnedge Avenue. This longtime neighborhood fixture pairs its upstairs setting with a menu that gives familiar diner food plenty of personality, from brioche Benedicts to French toast dressed for a celebration.\nRead full article\n2",
